Hello again,

There was also a message from Rob Kronlund concerning bootstrap 
confidence intervals in GAMs.  He said there were two things to consider:

(1) Bootstrap the original (X,Y) pairs of the data, where X may be a
matrix, or bootstrap the residuals from the GAM fit; 

(2) Should the smoothing parameters in any loess terms be estimated 
independently for each bootstrap iteration or should a global value of the 
smoothing parameters be estimated?

